  "description": "Step into a world where love, temptation, and fate collide.\n\nA mysterious demon appears before you with a chilling challenge: win the heart of your university professor… or be dragged into the depths of hell.\n\nAs your conversations grow more intimate, your every word shapes your destiny.\n\nWill you follow the demon’s wicked game, or defy him and choose your own path?\n\nYour choices matter... and every ending reveals a different truth about desire, freedom, and the price of love.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n● MULTIPLE ENDINGS: Every path leads to a different fate. And a different version of you.\n\n● CHOICE & CONSEQUENCE: What you say changes everything, even who survives.\n\n● SUPERNATURAL ROMANCE: A love story twisted by temptation, mystery, and desire.\n\n● ATMOSPHERIC EXPERIENCE: Stunning art and haunting music that draw you into the dark.\n\n\nIt’s seductive.\nIt’s dangerous.\nIt’s your soul on the line.\n\nAre you ready to play her game?",
